00:51:38.728 --> 00:52:01.407
It's the same feeling I had as a teenager, staring out bus windows with my earbuds in, dreaming of college, adulthood, love, something just around the corner, not quite tangible, but pulsing with promise, that hopeful ache, that beautiful suspense, sense, that goosebumps sense of something coming.
